  "question": {
    "text": "The ideal gas equation for 1 mol of ideal gas is&nbsp;PV = nRT<br />\rThe graph between P and T at constant volume, i.e. isochores are plotted as under<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0063_ed12e0fb3538.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 116px; width: 150px;\" /><br />\r<br />\rWhich of the following order of volume is correct?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
