  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "At constant temperature T, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> (for 1 mol gas).<br />Thus, correct sequence of volume will be<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>"
